    "title": "A New Live Music Venue Is Proposed for Old North Sacramento - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Juan Carlos Montoya ,\n2 hours ago A new live music venue is in the works at 1113 Del Paso Boulevard in Old North Sacramento, where Green Box LLC is proposing a 2,000-capacity entertainment space with a stage, mezzanine, bars, VIP areas, and outdoor patio space, according to details reported by the Sacramento Business Journal. The project is still working its way through city review, and no opening timeline has been set. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
